#. <CLT 4>よし…！　やるぞ…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Okay...! Let's do this!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. モノクマ、見てるんだろ！？
#. 話があるんだ！　出て来いよ！！
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Hey, Monokuma! You can see me, right!? Get out here!\n"
"I've got a bone to pick with you!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そして、しばらくすると……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Then, a few moments later...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. あらあら、珍しいじゃない。
#. 苗木クンの方から呼び出してくるなんてさ。
msgctxt "0004 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Well, well, this is a surprise! You being the one to\n"
"call me out..."
msgstr ""

#. ところで、苗木クンッ！
msgctxt "0005 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Hey, by the way!"
msgstr ""

#. な、なんだよ…
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "H-Huh?"
msgstr "Cái... gì...?"

#. 霧切さんと何してたの？
#. 深夜のお風呂場に２人きりなんて…
msgctxt "0007 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"What were you and Kyoko up to? Going to the bathhouse?\n"
"Just the two of you? In the middle of the night?"
msgstr ""

#. まさしく、アツアツ状態ですかぁ！？
msgctxt "0008 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Definitely a hot and steamy moment, wouldn't you say!?"
msgstr ""

#. アツアツでビショビショで…そんでもって…
msgctxt "0009 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "So warm and wet, so wet and warm... I bet you guys—"
msgstr ""

#. （ＣＥＲＯ規定に抵触の恐れがある為、削除。）
msgctxt "0010 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"[REMOVED TO CONFORM WITH LOCAL\n"
"AND INTERNATIONAL CENSORSHIP LAWS]"
msgstr ""

#. …ですかぁ！？
msgctxt "0011 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "—all over her, didn't you!?"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. 黙秘ですか…そうですか…
msgctxt "0013 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Not gonna talk, huh? Sure, I get it..."
msgstr ""

#. 別にいいけどね…苗木クンと違って、
#. ボクはお風呂になんて興味ないし…
msgctxt "0014 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Well, whatever. Unlike you, I have absolutely no\n"
"interest in late-night bath scenes."
msgstr ""

#. ボクは、Ｒ指定とは無縁の
#. 健全な監視生活を心掛けてるんで！
msgctxt "0015 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Because I like to maintain a healthy life of\n"
"observation, far away from X-rated X-ploits!"
msgstr ""

#. だから、浴場には監視カメラがないのか？
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Oh, so is that why there's no surveillance cameras in\n"
"the bathhouse?"
msgstr ""

#. 図星！
msgctxt "0017 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Bull's-eye!"
msgstr ""

#. でも本当は、湿気でレンズが曇るから、
#. 監視カメラを置けなかっただけじゃないのか？
msgctxt "0018 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Or is it maybe cuz the lens gets all fogged up, and\n"
"you can't see anything anyway?"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0019 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. こっちが…図星なんじゃ…
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Sounds like *that's* the bull's-eye to me..."
msgstr ""

#. そんな事より、なんの用なの！？
#. わざわざ、ボクを呼び出したりしてさ！
msgctxt "0021 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Anyway! You went to all that trouble to get me out\n"
"here, now whaddya want!?"
msgstr ""

#. えっと…それは…
msgctxt "0022 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Oh, well...umm..."
msgstr "Ồ, chuyện đó... ừm..."

#. お前に…確認したい事があるんだよ…
msgctxt "0023 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "There's just something I wanted to confirm with you."
msgstr ""

#. …オスかメスかって？
msgctxt "0024 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Whether I'm a mademoiselle or a dudefella?"
msgstr ""

#. クマには、オスもメスもないんだよ！
msgctxt "0025 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "But in the bear kingdom, there IS no male or female!"
msgstr ""

#. いや…あるだろ…
msgctxt "0026 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Um...actually, there is..."
msgstr ""

#. マジで！？
msgctxt "0027 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Seriously!?"
msgstr ""

#. じゃ、じゃあ…ボクってなんなんだよ…？
#. ボクの…存在って…
msgctxt "0028 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Th-Then...what am I? My entire existence..."
msgstr ""

#. や、やめよう…深く考えるとハマる…
#. それで…苗木クンの聞きたい事って…？
msgctxt "0029 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"That's enough! I'll get stuck if I think about it too\n"
"much. So what did you really wanna ask me?"
msgstr ""

#. えっと…さっき言ってたよな？
#. 宝物が盗まれたって…
msgctxt "0030 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Oh, well...you told us earlier that your precious had\n"
"been stolen."
msgstr ""

#. その宝物って…なんの事だよ…？
msgctxt "0031 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What's this \"precious\" of yours?"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0032 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. あのさ…まさかとは思うけど…
msgctxt "0033 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Listen...I'm sure this is a silly question, no way\n"
"it's possible and all, but..."
msgstr ""

#. それを聞く為だけに、
#. わざわざ、ボクを呼び出した訳じゃないよね？
msgctxt "0034 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"...is that seriously what you dragged me out here to\n"
"ask me?"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0035 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. ショックだよ！　１００メガショックだよ！！
msgctxt "0036 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"You gotta be kiddin' me! You gotta be 100-megaton\n"
"freakin' KIDDING me!"
msgstr ""

#. もっと大事な事を聞くんじゃないの？
#. ハチミツのとり方とか、繁殖期の過ごし方とか…
msgctxt "0037 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"You're not gonna ask something useful, like how to get\n"
"the best honey, or ursine breeding tips?"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0038 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. くだらない…思春期の少年って、
#. こんなにくだらないものなのか…？
msgctxt "0039 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"This is just crazy... Are all pubescent teen boys as\n"
"nutty as you!?"
msgstr ""

#. くだらなすぎて面倒だから教えてやるよ！
#. <CLT 3>“鍵”<CLT>と<CLT 3>“ほにゃらら”<CLT>だよ！　はい以上！！
msgctxt "0040 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"God, you're so annoying! Fine, I'll tell you!\n"
"It was a <CLT 3>key<CLT> and <CLT 3>******<CLT>! That's it!"
msgstr ""

#. ほにゃらら…？
msgctxt "0041 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What was that second thing...?"
msgstr ""

#. 察しろって！　そこは内緒なの！
msgctxt "0042 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "It's a blank, stupid! A secret! Fill it in yourself!"
msgstr ""

#. て言うか、こんな事でわざわざ呼び出すなんて、
#. ボクはオマエの脳の構造が知りたいよ！
msgctxt "0043 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Making me trudge all the way out here for that... I'd\n"
"like to see what's going on in that brain of yours!"
msgstr ""

#. 今度、こんなくだらない理由で呼び出したりしたら、
#. そん時は割って見せてもらうからねッ！
msgctxt "0044 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"And the next time you summon me for something so\n"
"stupid, I'll open up your skull and find out!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>語気を荒げながら、モノクマは去っていった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0045 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Dropping more than a few swear words, Monokuma stormed\n"
"off.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ふぅ……
msgctxt "0046 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Whew..."
msgstr "Phù..."

#. <CLT 4>モノクマの目は引き付けるって意味では、
#. 十分だったはずだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0047 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I hope I kept him distracted long enough...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>後は…霧切さんが無事に帰って来るのを、
#. 信じて待つだけだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0048 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Now all I can do is wait and hope Kyoko makes it out\n"
"okay.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>大丈夫…あの霧切さんなんだし…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0049 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>No, she'll be fine. It's Kyoko, after all.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>大丈夫…だよな…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0050 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'm sure she's fine...right?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>なかなか消えない不安を振り払うかのように、
#. 部屋へと戻ったボクは、すぐに眠りについた…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0051 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I went back to my room and laid down, doing my best to\n"
"settle my nerves and get back to sleep.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. モノクマＣＭ劇場。
#. 株式会社スパイク・チュンソフトの提供でお送りします。
msgctxt "0052 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Monokuma Theater, brought to you by\n"
"Spike Chunsoft Co., Ltd."
msgstr ""

#. へぇ、この超シャレオツなゲームの開発が
#. キャンセルされちゃったんだー？
msgctxt "0053 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Hmm? This super stylish, super fashionable game\n"
"was canceled during development?"
msgstr ""

#. でもダンガンロンパが売れれば再開されるんだって？
msgctxt "0054 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"But it'll start back up again if Danganronpa\n"
"sells well?"
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、オマエラも友達に勧めないとな！
msgctxt "0055 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Then you guys have to recommend it to your\n"
"friends, too!"
msgstr ""
